@startuml
title MW-03 - Project and Milestone Setup

start
:Open the project list;

:Load projects and clients;
:Display the project grid and the key metrics;

:Click "New project";
:Select an existing client or create a new one;
:Enter name, start date, deadline and description;

:Check that the deadline is after the start date;

if (Valid?) then (Yes)
  :Create the project;
  :Compute the project progress;
else (No)
  :Return a validation error;
  :Re-enter the project information;
  stop
endif

:Open the milestone page;
:Click "New milestone";
:Enter name, order and due date;

:Create the milestone;

:Continue with the project planning;

stop
@enduml
